<MainLayout title="Our Purpose">
  <section>
    <h2>Our Purpose</h2>
    <p>Our purpose is not simply to survive, but to live in a way that is meaningful, ethical, and beneficial to others.</p>
    <p>The document suggests that a purposeful life is built through virtue, compassion, care for family, and a willingness to seek wisdom beyond the self.</p>
    <p>Prayer, belief, and reflection are all treated as tools for becoming more grounded and more humane in the face of life’s uncertainties.</p>
    <p>It is no accident that the two most populous nations in the world are dominated by beliefs that do not subscribe to a single all powerful deity.</p>
    <p>Humankind took a great leap forward when they adopted monotheism, but based on all that I have learned about human history, adoption of monotheism was a huge step backwards for mankind in terms of tolerance for people of other beliefs.</p>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
